list.item:
Bunker, Ellsworth, Ambassador at Large;
                        alternate head of the U.S. delegation to the Geneva Middle East Peace
                        Conference from December 1973 until January 1974

Haig, Alexander M., Brigadier General, USA;
                        Deputy Assistant to the President for National Security Affairs until May
                        1973; White House Chief of Staff from May 1973

Scowcroft, Brent, Brigadier General, USAF;
                        Deputy Assistant to the President for National Security Affairs; after
                        February 1973, Military Assistant to the President
